  "goodToKnow": "Die Politikwissenschaft is political science, also called Politologie; in many universities the subject is just Politik or Sozialwissenschaften. Der Politologe (die Politologin) is a political scientist, often interviewed on election nights. After 1945 the subject was built up in West Germany partly to strengthen democratic education, for example at the Otto-Suhr-Institut in Berlin. It has no plural."
